# Comments / 留言板 (Supabase)
#
# Both keys are PUBLIC — they are baked into the static bundle at build time
# and visible in the browser. The Supabase anon key is designed for this; the
# real protection is the row-level security policies in `supabase/comments.sql`.
#
# Get these from your Supabase project → Settings → API.
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your-anon-key>
